    "[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/esc.tres[/img]\t\t일시정지/메뉴\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/q.tres[/img]\t\t영웅 스킬 1\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/w.tres[/img]\t\t영웅 스킬 2\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/e.tres[/img]\t\t영웅 스킬 3\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/1.tres[/img]\t\t추가 스킬 1\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/2.tres[/img]\t\t추가 스킬 2\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/3.tres[/img]\t\t추가 스킬 3\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/r.tres[/img]\t\t이동 리셋\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/f.tres[/img]\t\t물약 사용\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/space.tres[/img]\t\t턴 종료\n\t[img=30]res://images/ui_icon/h.tres[/img]\t\t도움말/튜토리얼",
